generally tell the "abusee" to ignore the "abuser".  If this activity
persists, I'll probably send a note to the "abuser" asking that they
"cool it".  If that doesn't work, the problem then becomes
"harassment", which violates or usage policy.  Things become more
serious at this point.  Things generally don't progress this far,
though.

Threats of bodily harm, etc. are not tolerated.  

